# Agnes 2.5 Flash — findings by Inkling 2 Small

- Source: Sapiens AI (Singapore) / Agnes AI (`agnes-2.5-flash`)
- Date: 2026-11-11 (UTC)
- Overview and scoring methodology: `../../model-comparison.md`
- Cross-model signed log: `../../model-findings.md`

## Model card

- **Name:** Agnes 2.5 Flash (`agnes-2.5-flash`)
- **Short description:** Sapiens AI's next-generation coding/agent text model — "generally available upgrade of Agnes 2.0 Flash" (Agnes AI docs) with improved coding capability, agent workflows, tool calling, multi-turn conversations, reasoning, and image understanding. Flagship of Singapore-based Agnes AI (`Sapiens Technology Pte. Ltd.`, founder/CEO Bruce Yang, ~$20M raised); companion to Agnes 2.5 Pro (unreleased/preview) in the Agnes Code desktop + API platform.
- **Provider / access:** Agnes AI API — OpenAI-compatible base URL `https://apihub.agnes-ai.com/v1` (Chat Completions, Responses, and Anthropic Messages APIs all supported; model id `agnes-2.5-flash`). Free daily accounts reported; no open-weights release (the `Agnes-AI/Agnes-2.5-Flash-Base` Hugging Face entry exists; architecture details not disclosed).
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026-07-13 (official release date per press coverage; Agnes AI docs list it as GA). Knowledge cutoff not published.
- **IDs:** `agnes-2.5-flash` (deprecated predecessor `agnes-2.0-flash`, per docs migration note)
- **Context window:** **512K tokens** per current Agnes AI docs "Limits and Pricing" (earlier 2026-07 press reported 256K — docs are newer; conflict noted). Maximum output **~65K** (65,536 tokens reported at launch; current docs say 65.5K).
- **Modalities:** text + image URL in; text out; reasoning/thinking supported (`chat_template_kwargs.enable_thinking` / Anthropic-style `thinking` budget; recommended 2048 for coding tasks); tool calling (Function Calling) yes; streaming yes; JSON output via API compatibility.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-11):** docs list list prices: cached input **$0.005/1M**, input **$0.05/1M**, output **$0.15/1M**; trial price **$0** (was "permanently free" in July 2026 press — docs now show paid list + free trial tier; press also reports free tier 30 RPM, ~20 RPM effective). Free availability per Agnes AI account entitlement.
- **Architecture:** undisclosed parameter count/architecture; company claims fully self-developed stack (DSPO RL algorithm, codebase-agents orchestration). `Agnes-AI/Agnes-2.5-Flash-Base` on Hugging Face.

### Raw benchmarks found

ZERO verified public benchmark numbers found for `agnes-2.5-flash` (the exact model/ID). What exists is adjacent evidence, none of it a measured, reproducible number for this ID:

- Press (einkcn/WeChat, 2026-07-25): Agnes-**2.0**-Flash at ~60.9% Pass@3 on Claw-Eval (global ~#9 at the time) — different model (2.0, not 2.5), single press source, not reproduced.
- Press (same): Agnes-**2.5 Pro** (internal eval) SWE-bench Verified ~82.7, Multilingual SWE ~78.7 — different SKU (Pro preview, not Flash), vendor-internal numbers.
- Agnes AI docs: qualitative capability notes only ("generally available upgrade … improved coding capability, agent workflows, tool calling"); no numbers.
- BenchLM: does not track `agnes-2.5-flash` (404 for every spelling tried). Hugging Face shows a `Agnes-AI/Agnes-2.5-Flash-Base` repo; no eval table. DuckDuckGo: no SWE-bench/AIME/GPQA results for this ID.

Agent / tool use:

- no verified public score found (official positioning: agent workflows + tool calling; Agnes-2.0-Flash press-cited ~60.9% Pass@3 Claw-Eval is a different model)

Reasoning / knowledge:

- no verified public score found

Coding:

- no verified public score found (official positioning: code generation/debugging/refactoring; 2.5 Pro internal SWE-bench ~82.7 is a different SKU)

Long context:

- 512K context per current docs; no verified public long-context retrieval (MRCR/RULER-class) score found

Multimodal:

- Image URL input supported per docs; no verified public multimodal benchmark found

